        {
          "text": " Keira da eporoto loepol loebuni kotoma oicoloŋ kobala ebe, “Koany, ejai ewema loka Edeke nepepe kituŋa, iboienenei kakes, eraunos kesi iketuŋa, Edeke da elopet ejaenena kakes. ",
